        "Categories": {
          "value": "Taken with Nikon D40|Tripods (photography)|IPhone 3GS|Images with annotations|Travel gear|Wi-Fi routers and access points|Rode Microphones|Camera straps|Powerbanks|Flickr images uploaded by Flickr upload bot|Images with 10+ annotations|Uploaded by user Clusternote|Camera accessories|Assorted photography equipment|Microphone accessories|Bags and contents|TomTom products|CradlePoint PHS300|Elgato Turbo.264|Huawei E169|Novatel S720|Video encoders",
