        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<dl><dt>My Digital Travelling Lifestyle Tech Bag (by Phil Campbell)</dt></dl>\n<p>You can collect together a bunch of tech over a year.  some of this i'll be taking on the twestival mission next week.   i will put notes on each thing once i have uploaded\n</p><p><i>1st row</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>this way i can find my luggage.  no pun intended.</li>\n<li>the xlr convertor for my iphone.</li></ul>\n<p><i>2nd row</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>digital led 5300k daylight glow - lovely for photos and videos</li>\n<li>sprint merlin evdo card.</li>\n<li>cradlepoint phs300 - great wifi hotspot router.</li>\n<li>the blue mikey.  great iphone and itouch addon.</li>\n<li>my very broken nokia stand.  on it's 'last legs' boom boom.</li>\n<li>elgato h264 encoder on a chip.  great usb device for mobile media makers.</li>\n<li>tomtom go with european maps</li>\n<li>global traveller charger.  can be a bit big thou, need to source smaller one.</li>\n<li>manfrotto steadycam - for $100 what do you expect but a good halfway house.</li></ul>\n<p><i>3rd &amp; 4th row</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>huawei e169 broadband backup.</li>\n<li>the micport pro adapter.</li>\n<li>rode ntg-2 broadcast quality microphone - xlr.  uses adapter cable for great sound for iphone.</li>\n<li>bogstandard iphone3g</li>\n<li>cheapo backup ebay 1 shot power for the iphone - can be recharged.</li>\n<li>6-1 - charge most mobile devices.  pretty awesome cable.</li>\n<li>rota hub - usb hub and card reader block with swivel arms for the usb ports.</li>\n<li>cerrulean f1 bluetooth 2.0 stereo headphones.  uber badass.  can be uncomfortable after a while thou.</li></ul>",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "DateTimeOriginal": {
          "value": "2009-09-06 12:59:15",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
